                                "sense_id": "d8d766fd-ebf6-36ad-a9f0-13f0b44aaedb",
                                "text": "For aspiring Saurons and Darth Sidiouses, the game allows the player to fill the boots of a big evil Overlord with a handful of minions to start out with."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "af5b9c8d-afd2-4ac1-957b-7e5edca9a85a",
                                "sense_id": "d8d766fd-ebf6-36ad-a9f0-13f0b44aaedb",
                                "text": "Torture, indeed, like enslavement, has traditionally been iconic of pure evil, the practice of a Sauron or a Saddam Hussein."
